TXN# — Matches the fixed prefix.
(\\d+) — Captures the transaction ID (one or more digits).
-\\d{2}- — Matches the status code (2 digits, ignored).
(\\w+) — Captures the status (alphanumeric text like SUCCESS, PENDING, etc.).
